ensus-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+03:01/60:00 c16/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_stevolsu","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /root/i.ar"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[19:43:24] total 84\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   208 Sep 19 19:19 .\ndr-xr-x---. 1 root root    38 Sep 19 19:40 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   208 Sep 19 19:40 .git\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   124 Sep 19 12:41 .gitignore\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 29356 Sep 19 12:41 GUIDELINES.org\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root    88 Sep 19 12:41 HISTORY.log\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 35149 Sep 19 12:41 LICENSE\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  7804 Sep 19 12:41 README.org\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root     6 Aug 30 05:24 audit\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root    42 Sep 19 12:41 containers\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   160 Sep 19 19:40 emacs.d\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root    18 Sep 19 12:41 metaconfig\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   116 Sep 19 12:41 prompts\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root    22 Aug 30 05:24 test\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   148 Sep 19 12:41 utils\n\n[t+03:18/60:00 c17/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_xsskl031","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < /root/p